projection;
strict ( 2 );

"Device-facing API surface, self-service only: a device authenticates,
"rotates its own session and changes its own password. login and refresh
"return the caller's effective functions inside ZA_MOB_LoginResult for
"rendering the menu; that list is never trusted as input again.
"Everything administrative - creating accounts and assigning roles -
"belongs to the Fiori services. Never add "use action createUser",
""use update" or the _Roles association here: this projection is what
"keeps them off the mobile API.
define behavior for ZC_MOB_User alias MobileUser
{
  use action login;
  use action logout;
  use action refresh;
  use action changePassword;
}
